{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgqarwuqkz","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Competitor analysis: how KB/memory systems handle knowledge decay and low quality writes","summary":"Surveyed Zep/Graphiti, Mem0, Letta/MemGPT, Cognee, Memary, FadeMem, YourMemory, RGMem, MemOS, A-MEM, LangMem, GraphRAG family (June 2026, primary sources). Two findings.\n\nDECAY splits into two camps almost nobody combines: (1) reactive bi-temporal invalidation (Zep/Graphiti gold standard, Mem0-g, Cognee, zonoid) closes a fact's validity window only when a contradicting fact arrives, never deletes — precise and auditable but stale-uncontradicted facts live forever, NO proactive sweep even in Zep; (2) proactive forgetting curves (FadeMem dual-Weibull, YourMemory Ebbinghaus+recall-reinforce, MemoryBank, MemoryOS heat, SSGM) prune by age/disuse but are blind to truth and kill valid-but-quiet facts (MemoryBank performs worst in own bench). GraphRAG family has NO logical-staleness handling (keeps stale edges forever).\n\nQUALITY: the whole field gates at WRITE time with an LLM judge — Mem0 AUDN (ADD/UPDATE/DELETE/NOOP), Zep contradiction check, FadeMem 4-way, DEG-RAG threshold (drop <0.2 → +15pt), RGMem corroboration threshold theta_inf=3. Dominant flaw: same model extracts AND judges = correlated failure. Almost nobody gates on OUTCOME.\n\nPRODUCTION VALIDATION of zonoid's thesis: Cursor REMOVED Memories in 2.1.x (reverted to manual Rules); ChatGPT memory was 41.5% accurate, fixed only by adding a background synthesis/judging pass (Dreaming, ->82.8%). Unjudged accretion fails; the judge loop is the moat.\n\nZONOID POSITION: at parity with Zep on bi-temporal notes (closes Zep temporal gap); AHEAD on three combined things nobody else has — separate adversarial judge (defeats correlated failure), outcome-grounded recall-attribution quality signal (field only gates at ingestion, never looks back), and the empirical/non-derivable content bar. Top borrowable gap: decay on USEFULNESS not age — feed the recall-outcome journal into a decay/confidence score so never-recalled-and-helpful notes fade and notes that pay off reinforce; bridges both decay camps without camp-2's downside. Also","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T14:19:42.414Z","vec":[-0.03362845256924629,0.004126007203012705,-0.07459189742803574,0.018941130489110947,0.038885682821273804,-0.036904048174619675,-0.041914574801921844,0.08019997179508209,-0.009472263045608997,0.06452709436416626,0.026146603748202324,0.03235413134098053,0.09581032395362854,-0.002237585373222828,-0.029140032827854156,0.04472688212990761,0.04405079782009125,0.032541342079639435,-0.08572807163000107,-0.03339725732803345,0.0013927314430475235,-0.057819269597530365,0.0001465304521843791,0.011960686184465885,-0.04376554116606712,0.011649264954030514,-0.05752705782651901,-0.006371445022523403,-0.011309470981359482,-0.09938771277666092,-0.011161807924509048,0.1045776829123497,-0.020013131201267242,0.014294283464550972,-0.019262036308646202,0.033914241939783096,-0.04909547418355942,-0.018996430560946465,-0.0209277905523777,-0.040505144745111465,-0.023648295551538467,0.07831285893917084,-0.07731590420007706,-0.012478367425501347,0.05765920504927635,0.0007547861314378679,-0.044071003794670105,-0.01162637397646904,-0.09561620652675629,0.020563211292028427,-0.11070482432842255,0.02577398531138897,-0.019941560924053192,0.08543851971626282,0.022032812237739563,0.06967179477214813,0.02202046848833561,0.020922884345054626,-0.06607636064291,-0.0042302231304347515,0.017881037667393684,-0.07362043112516403,-0.08587165176868439,-0.024057967588305473,0.003733652178198099,0.038827553391456604,0.06567500531673431,0.033410001546144485,0.006410235073417425,0.03912078216671944,-0.005143667105585337,0.010802875272929668,-0.09942933917045593,0.021412426605820656,-0.023855971172451973,0.09191688150167465,0.04730556905269623,-0.012699720449745655,0.015655549243092537,-0.09707722812891006,-0.02367267571389675,-0.013246433809399605,0.0118090026080